---
// Menu & Food Details Component
---

<div>
  <p class="section-subtitle">A culinary celebration</p>

  <div class="menu-category">
    <h3>Cocktail Hour</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Assorted hors d'oeuvres</li>
      <li>Seasonal cheese and charcuterie board</li>
      <li>Fresh vegetable crudités with hummus</li>
      <li>Signature cocktails and wine selection</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="menu-category">
    <h3>Dinner Service</h3>
    <p class="menu-note">Guests will select their entrée upon RSVP</p>

    <div class="menu-option">
      <h4>Entrée Option 1</h4>
      <p>Pan-seared salmon with lemon butter, roasted vegetables, and wild rice pilaf</p>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-option">
      <h4>Entrée Option 2</h4>
      <p>Herb-crusted chicken breast with garlic mashed potatoes and seasonal greens</p>
    </div>

    <div class="menu-option">
      <h4>Vegetarian Option</h4>
      <p>Butternut squash risotto with roasted mushrooms and parmesan</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="menu-category">
    <h3>Dessert</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Wedding cake</li>
      <li>Assorted mini desserts</li>
      <li>Coffee and tea service</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="dietary-note">
    <p>
      <strong>Dietary Restrictions:</strong> Please let us know about any dietary
      restrictions or allergies when you RSVP. We'll work with our caterer to
      accommodate your needs.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
  }

  .menu-category {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .menu-category:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .menu-category h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    color: #111;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .menu-category ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    list-style-type: none;
  }

  .menu-category ul li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.5;
    position: relative;
  }

  .menu-category ul li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: -1rem;
    color: #999;
  }

  .menu-note {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .menu-option {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .menu-option h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
    color: #111;
  }

  .menu-option p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .dietary-note {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
  }

  .dietary-note p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .dietary-note strong {
    color: #111;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .menu-category h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .menu-option h4 {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .menu-category ul li,
    .menu-option p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  }
</style>
